id: pm-vcs-toolchain-1110
title: Adapt isolated telemetry fixture to the global settings owner
description: "Adapt the SDK 2026.11.6 fixture for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/pull/194 while preserving real local collector assertions."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-vcs#194"
created_at: "2026-11-10T12:34:10.025Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-10T17:14:39.301Z"
author: codex-toolchain-1110
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-10T12:34:14.995Z",codex-toolchain-1110,"Installed CHANGELOG 2026.11.5 names GH-1660 (pm-gh1660): project telemetry was inert; consent and endpoint now belong solely to the global profile, and init omits telemetry from project settings. The fixture incorrectly copied a project settings object and mutated its absent telemetry block. Read the authoritative global settings through public readSettings, explicitly opt that isolated profile in, and route its endpoint to the real local HTTP collector before running labelled children. Keep the hard opt-out and assert zero telemetry/Sentry requests."
  "2026-11-10T12:45:16.768Z",codex-toolchain-1110,"Focused real-collector regression passes 1/1 with zero failed/skipped tests; global fixture consent is explicitly enabled, while the hard test opt-out prevents both event and Sentry delivery. Auto-merge disabled before any push. Regenerate the staged self-host archive as required by AGENTS.md; release gates follow."
  "2026-11-10T17:14:38.474Z",codex-toolchain-1110,"Final focused verification under SDK 2026.11.6: the complete changed test/test-environment.test.ts passes 6/6, zero failures/skips/cancellations. The real local collector receives neither telemetry nor Sentry delivery even with explicit test labels and enabled fixture consent. npm run typecheck, npm run build, npm run build:test and changelog:check pass. An initial direct run lacked built dist prerequisites; building them resolved that setup failure without changing assertions. Only the test module changed, with no other test modules importing it. GH-1660 (CHANGELOG 2026.11.5) makes the global profile the telemetry owner. Orchestrator leaves full gates to CI. Refresh the staged self-host archive, retain the item in progress, and release the claim; auto-merge is disabled before push."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  selfhost.bundle,project
  test/test-environment.test.ts,project
tests[2]:
  - command: node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern='test children deliver no pm telemetry' test/test-environment.test.ts
    scope: project
    provenance:
